     A                                      DSPATR(RI)
     A                                  1 34'DSPSIZ'
     A            PGMNAM        10A  O  2  3DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  4  3'The program you are trying to run'
     A                                  5  3'requires a 132-column display.  Yo-
     A                                      u'
     A                                  6  3'will need to change your session'
     A                                  7  3'settings to run this program.'
     A                                  9  3'If using 5250 emulation, you can d-
     A                                      o'
     A                                 10  3'the following:'
     A                                 12  3'Sign off the computer and then'
     A                                 13  3'Select'
     A                                 13 11'Communication'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                 13 26'menu,'
     A                                 13 32'option'
     A                                 14  3'Configure'
     A                                      DSPATR(UL)
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                 14 14'and then size: 27x132.'
     A                                 16 10'Press ENTER to continue'
     A          R DUMMY2                    ASSUME
     A                                 11  1' '
     A          R DUMMY1
